 takes us on a poignant quest, from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TIEQlqnvBhoQ7kNvwHjb1Pl&_nc_oc=Adr1nVMBLCnG4_Z9YvIwFR_qHUqm0AE3m6b1-a91kkYgHzBxFMzSVGBIOCXgoEHuJ0Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQESguUHnPxrV9QRP0V5SrxPu1DdVtGw69alx2nja5-oHQ&oe=6A7DA801"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8bnIg6wPJ0AQ7kNvwHB9Sb6&_nc_oc=AdoIpak1hzwp0jFxMqz7JN-KDrknSy9ZgDDy11xxwdnXUp63iyU0CwpjvCspeAdZw6Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQETo8lCH05tSFq98xNCJF4Gs03-1NPocm_QuyJznB3gYg&oe=6A7DB566"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S4XszIEd-IMQ7kNvwHPkRFM&_nc_oc=AdohGlJxHd9akUrhjsF5Xj3udh1LH_fXq5NIs2v-TqoIGFfmDMN0Lb9mvagVK6OiUYM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE7JhQvsfDXZ6sZu0ZAOxXtj6PrwfCCKg6La